# Cloudflare Workers static assets headers: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/
#
# NOTE: unlike classic Cloudflare Pages, when two matching rules set the SAME
# header name here, Workers assets joins both values with a comma instead of
# letting the more specific rule win. So each header name below is defined in
# exactly one rule — otherwise /_astro/* would inherit a broken, concatenated
# Cache-Control (short-cache from the general rule + immutable from its own).

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY

# Hashed, content-addressed build output (_astro/*.HASH.ext) never changes
# under the same URL, so it's safe to cache forever.
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
